<p>President Trump said he told Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu that he disapproved of Israel’s strike on Iran’s South Pars gas field and does not want further attacks on Iranian energy infrastructure, as tit-for-tat strikes on energy facilities deepened the regional crisis and jolted oil and gas markets. Several reports said the attack raised fresh questions about how closely Washington and Jerusalem are coordinating in the war involving Iran. Israeli officials said the United States had been informed or consulted beforehand, while Trump said the United States had not known about the strike. The stakes are both strategic and economic. Reuters-based reporting cited by multiple outlets said Iran retaliated with strikes affecting energy-related targets in other Gulf states, pushing energy prices higher and heightening concern about wider disruption around the Gulf. One potentially stabilizing note in the latest developments is Trump’s public insistence that the energy strikes should not be repeated and that he has no plans to send U.S. ground troops, signaling an effort to limit further escalation even as the broader conflict continues.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Bw0WLjZLpH5cVHbiAQtm1W0ZjNIQLUDSV_9kjE5iS6GcFamkKzRjNm1fITG78mqTgMOOPU0TvgFq_I1ngv9H6gwePh0Hay7DF7AYJsho0NBZJBvkOnqfvOfg8s5jIo0B1mJFIwxf3xxHqYoidgQRFkEBwmL4fH2n6tiXgi-2znLctXyr-YQ' alt='President Trump has been trying to preserve Iran’s oil and gas infrastructure and keep the country from retaliating at energy facilities throughout the Persian Gulf.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Public rupture: Novara Media described the dispute as an unusually open U.S.-Israeli split, with both sides effectively briefing against each other over the South Pars strike.</li><li>Oval Office setting: Trump made the comment while meeting Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi, turning the warning into a public message delivered in front of another U.S. ally.</li></ul><blockquote>I told him, ‘Don’t do that’, and he won’t do that, - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump: Trump publicly framed the South Pars strike as a move he opposed and said he is trying to keep Iran’s oil and gas infrastructure intact, rather than trigger broader regional retaliation through energy markets. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/19/us/politics/trump-netanyahu-iran-gas-field-attack.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>Israeli officials: Israeli officials said Washington had been informed or consulted before the South Pars operation, signaling that Jerusalem sees the action as part of a coordinated wartime strategy even if the public message later diverged. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-netanyahu-split-on-gas-field-attack-raise-questions-about-whether-theyre-in-sync-on-war/article70763333.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>BBC analysis: BBC reported that Trump’s post and comments pointed to a tactical gap with Israel over whether striking energy assets would help or dangerously widen the war, even though both governments remain aligned against Iran more broadly. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c8x7leknlywo'>BBC News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/19/us/politics/trump-netanyahu-iran-gas-field-attack.html'>Trump’s Complaint About Israeli Strike on Gas Field Exposes Divergent Strategies</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://novaramedia.com/2026/03/19/trump-and-israel-split-erupts-over-gas-field-attacks/'>Trump and Israel Split Erupts Over Gas Field Attacks</a> - novaramedia.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-netanyahu-split-on-gas-field-attack-raise-questions-about-whether-theyre-in-sync-on-war/article70763333.ece'>Trump, Netanyahu split on gas field attack, raise questions about whether they’re in sync on war</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c8x7leknlywo'>Are US and Israel aligned on Iran war? Deciphering Trump&#x27;s post after gas field attacks</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/trump-tells-israel-not-to-repeat-strikes-on-irans-energy-as-crisis-deepens'>Trump tells Israel not to repeat strikes on Iran’s energy, as crisis deepens</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://michaelwest.com.au/trump-tells-israel-not-to-strike-iranian-energy-again/'>Trump tells Israel not to strike Iranian energy again</a> - michaelwest.com.au</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-tells-israel-not-repeat-strikes-iranian-energy-crisis-deepens'>Trump tells Israel not to repeat strikes on Iranian energy as crisis deepens</a> - al-monitor.com</li></ul>